</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Journey is Different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no set path. Every voyage offers new choices, fresh opportunities, and unexpected twists. In <i>Pirate Den</i>, every run tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.poster.avif?t=1765727343\" width=500 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.webm?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/extras/2ade96e3d428629213c95b3ce231e780.mp4?t=1765727343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sneak Your Way to the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why choose between working and being a pirate captain? With a discreet interface, <i>Pirate Den</i> lets you recruit, sail, and plunder \u2014 all while looking perfectly busy on your screen. No one will suspect you're aiming for the crown.</p>","developers":["Patate Douce Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768420/0d4114284be33b42b48ba7cf5045a23e72685cb5/header.jpg?t=1765727343","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1